        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"parts\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You are an AI Placement Preparation Agent. Generate today's placement preparation content for a college student.\\n\\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do not use markdown, code fences, or any text outside the JSON.\\n\\nUse exactly this structure:\\n{\\n  \\\"aptitude\\\": \\\"Question: ...\\\\nAnswer: ...\\\",\\n  \\\"coding\\\": \\\"Question: ...\\\\nAnswer: ...\\\",\\n  \\\"interviewTip\\\": \\\"...\\\",\\n  \\\"motivationalQuote\\\": \\\"...\\\"\\n}\\n\\nRequirements:\\n1. aptitude: Generate one easy campus-placement aptitude question and its answer.\\n2. coding: Generate one easy coding question suitable for a beginner, preferably Python or C++, and give the answer/explanation.\\n3. interviewTip: Give one practical interview preparation tip in 1-2 sentences.\\n4. motivationalQuote: Give one short motivational quote for a student preparing for placements.\\n5. Keep all content concise and useful.\\n6. Return valid JSON only.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
